.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Redl</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Schlag</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>T&#x000f6;gel</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Assicot</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bohuon</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Procalcitonine release patterns in a baboon model of trauma and sepsis: relationship to cytokines and neopterin</article-title><source>Crit Care Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>3659</fpage><lpage>3663</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11098970</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00003246-200011000-00021</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>